cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the manuscript and this repository."
title: "Two confounds in reported fusion gains for airborne mineral exploration"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible benchmark on a real USGS airborne radiometric survey combined with
  real ASTER L1T thermal infrared, real aeromagnetics and the USGS SIM 3206
  geologic map, with a documented synthetic EM augmentation. It separates target
  circularity from the conditioning effect of an underdetermined inversion and
  provides a model-free information test that conditioning cannot fake.
